    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d702">

                <pb facs="0809" n="724" sameAs="frus:frus1919v02/pg724"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">823.00/261a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Minister in Peru</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">McMillin</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-07-08T18:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 8, 1919, 6
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>Is Leguia planning to have new congressional elections and if so
                        when?</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>Is he planning new presidential election?</item>
                    <label>3.</label>
                    <item>Have you tangible evidence in your possession that statements made by
                        Leguia party which have appeared in the press are true, to the effect that
                        Pardo attempted to use fraud in decision of presidential election
                        contest?</item>
                </list>
                <p>Rush reply.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
